Third-party code vendored into this repository
==============================================

Everything under `reference/vendor/` was written by someone else and is
committed unmodified. It is here so that `vectors.json` can be re-derived
offline for as long as this repository exists: a reference that has to be
downloaded is a reference that can disappear, and one did during the week this
was written.

Nothing in `vendor/` is executed at import time, and nothing in this repository
depends on it at runtime. It is run only by `reference/js-vectors.js`, and only
when regenerating or checking the pinned vectors.


