    http://www.xarg.org/download/pnglib.js
    Copyright (c) 2010, Robert Eisele <robert@xarg.org>
    BSD License

    Vendored at: reference/vendor/pnglib.js
    Modified:    no

A dependency of identicon.js for its PNG output path. The vector harness reads
identicon.js's **SVG** output rather than its PNG, so this file is present for
completeness rather than because the vectors depend on it.


Refreshing the vendored library
-------------------------------

If `vendor/` is ever updated, change the commit hash above and in
`reference/README.md`, regenerate `vectors.json`, and expect **every identicon
to change**. The vectors are the specification, so a reference bump is a visual
change to every project's mark rather than a maintenance detail.
